# KFAR Marketplace - Environment Variables Template
# Deployed on Hostinger VPS with PostgreSQL

## Required Variables (Database)

```bash
# PostgreSQL Database (Hostinger VPS)
POSTGRES_HOST=72.61.201.237
POSTGRES_PORT=5432
POSTGRES_DB=kfar_marketplace
POSTGRES_USER=kfar
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=your-password-here
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://kfar:your-password-here@72.61.201.237:5432/kfar_marketplace
```

## Required Variables (App)

```bash
# App Configuration
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://kfar.village-of-peace.com
```

## AI Services (Optional)

```bash
# OpenRouter (for AI chat)
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your-openrouter-key

# Google Gemini AI
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-key

# DeepSeek (alternative AI)
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=your-deepseek-key

# ElevenLabs (for voice)
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your-elevenlabs-key
```

## Messaging Services (Optional)

```bash
# WhatsApp Business API
WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN=
WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=
WHATSAPP_BUSINESS_ACCOUNT_ID=

# Twilio (SMS)
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=

# SendGrid (Email)
SENDGRID_API_KEY=
```

## Cache Services (Optional)

```bash
# Redis Cache (Upstash)
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
```

## How to Deploy to VPS

1. SSH into the VPS: `ssh root@72.61.201.237`
2. Navigate to app directory: `cd /opt/kfar`
3. Pull latest code: `git pull origin main`
4. Install dependencies: `npm install`
5. Build: `npm run build`
6. Restart PM2: `pm2 restart kfar`

## Database Access (SSH)

```bash
ssh root@72.61.201.237
sudo -u postgres psql kfar_marketplace
```
